No…

263
00:13:47,973 --> 00:13:50,851
A scorned woman's revenge is terrifying.

264
00:13:50,934 --> 00:13:53,562
My former boss had an affair,
and his wife almost stabbed him.

265
00:13:53,646 --> 00:13:54,980
Wait, seriously?

266
00:13:55,064 --> 00:13:57,858
-That's terrifying!
-Hey, don't say that in front of him.

267
00:13:57,941 --> 00:14:00,611
Are you getting a divorce?
Have you even talked to her?

268
00:14:00,694 --> 00:14:03,614
He ran here right after
the articles came out.

269
00:14:03,697 --> 00:14:04,907
So I bet they haven't talked.

270
00:14:04,990 --> 00:14:06,492
No, I mean…

271
00:14:06,575 --> 00:14:08,827
Well, no.

272
00:14:10,287 --> 00:14:11,330
What? Who is it?

273
00:14:11,955 --> 00:14:14,124
Who is it?!

274
00:14:16,251 --> 00:14:17,169
Yes?

275
00:14:17,711 --> 00:14:20,589
My apologies for showing up unannounced.

276
00:14:22,257 --> 00:14:23,634
Who might you be?

277
00:14:24,343 --> 00:14:25,761
I am…

278
00:14:26,428 --> 00:14:28,514
Jin Ichijo's wife.

279
00:14:31,517 --> 00:14:32,726
Is…

280
00:14:33,394 --> 00:14:34,853
my husband here?

281
00:14:54,581 --> 00:14:56,417
You too. You came here…

282
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:58,877
to take a vacation, didn't you?

283
00:14:58,961 --> 00:15:00,379
<i>What are we going to do?</i>

284
00:15:00,462 --> 00:15:02,297
<i>To think his wife would come here…</i>

285
00:15:02,381 --> 00:15:04,258
<i>This will be a bloodbath.</i>

286
00:15:04,341 --> 00:15:06,760
Idiot!

287
00:15:07,761 --> 00:15:09,722
<i>-Check if there's a weapon inside!</i>
<i>-Yes!</i>

288
00:15:09,805 --> 00:15:11,932
It's better than going to hell, right?

289
00:15:12,016 --> 00:15:13,392
Just what are you?

290
00:15:14,184 --> 00:15:15,477
No!

291
00:15:15,561 --> 00:15:17,396
Wait, no. Bad, that's bad.

292
00:15:17,479 --> 00:15:18,605
Seriously?

293
00:15:18,689 --> 00:15:21,817
-Ryoko!
-Darling!

294
00:15:22,401 --> 00:15:23,694
Romance, huh.

295
00:15:23,777 --> 00:15:27,114
<i>Midori, you seriously</i>
<i>need to get a boyfriend soon!</i>

296
00:15:29,658 --> 00:15:30,617
Subtitle translation by: Nix S.

